; ghostpc.nfx -- GhostPC's own effects. GhostPC appends this file to game.nfx when the game reads it (xapi.cpp), so
; the original stays untouched. Same syntax as game.nfx.

; The Reaver's Scarab (proj_reaverScarab, Misc/Templates/ghostpc.not): a trail of smaller blue glows left behind the
; photon glow (tossTurretProj), shrinking and fading like afterimages (after arcliteTrail, sparser and smaller)
smoke				scarabTrail
material			GE_PAR_LensFlare1_blue
startcolor		0xc0a0a0ff
endcolor			0x00a0a0ff
max_particles	40
spawn_delay		0.05
duration			8
part_life		0.4
part_size0		1.2
part_size1		0.2
velocity_z		0
type_flags		0x01
flags				0x400
renderradius	25
priority			2
end
